(The siblings' second assignment: Wild rock seaweed)

835
00:33:02,096 --> 00:33:03,656
(Gyeonnaeryang, a narrow strait between Tongyeong and Geoje)

836
00:33:03,656 --> 00:33:05,266
(Gyeonnaeryang, a narrow strait between Tongyeong and Geoje)

837
00:33:06,196 --> 00:33:08,166
The sea is very clean in this area.

