- Got it.

856
00:33:58,846 --> 00:33:59,986
- We love it.
- Wild rock seaweed.

857
00:33:59,986 --> 00:34:00,986
- Wild rock seaweed.
- Wild rock seaweed.

858
00:34:00,986 --> 00:34:02,386
The wild rock seaweed in this area...

859
00:34:02,386 --> 00:34:04,786
can only be harvested 15 days a year.

860
00:34:04,786 --> 00:34:06,126
