I pick this one.

879
00:34:42,096 --> 00:34:43,796
- It's seaweed.
- I'll just take the last one.

880
00:34:43,996 --> 00:34:45,496
What should we do? Should we just grab it?

881
00:34:45,766 --> 00:34:46,926
