- It's 9.3m long.

1006
00:39:48,266 --> 00:39:49,436
And it weighs...

1007
00:39:50,136 --> 00:39:52,806
about 12kg to 13kg.

1008
00:39:52,806 --> 00:39:53,806
It's heavy.

1009
00:39:54,366 --> 00:39:56,306
