- I might have to quit the show.

1517
00:59:43,421 --> 00:59:44,691
- Yes.
- He recruited me.

1518
00:59:44,691 --> 00:59:46,161
He said we're doing good now.

1519
00:59:46,161 --> 00:59:48,531
