1573
01:02:09,671 --> 01:02:11,671
I told you not to drive the boat!

1574
01:02:12,671 --> 01:02:14,711
I told you not to drive the boat!

1575
01:02:16,801 --> 01:02:18,771
I told you not to drive the boat!

1576
01:02:19,871 --> 01:02:21,871
I told you not to drive the boat!

1577
01:02:23,671 --> 01:02:25,311
Why did you take the boat?

1578
01:02:25,571 --> 01:02:28,141
