1583
01:02:36,621 --> 01:02:39,091
Who gives you the right to do whatever because you're shooting?

1584
01:02:40,561 --> 01:02:41,921
What are you shooting anyway?

1585
01:02:42,561 --> 01:02:45,331
I told you not to take the boat. Why did you take it?

1586
01:02:46,391 --> 01:02:49,001
