I give two thumbs up.

1654
01:04:58,291 --> 01:04:59,431
What was tough about that?

1655
01:04:59,961 --> 01:05:01,261
(They're the best.)

1656
01:05:01,731 --> 01:05:02,861
It was tough.

1657
