We just need to load the cart with the seaweed.

1658
01:05:07,071 --> 01:05:08,771
Gosh. Good job.

1659
01:05:08,771 --> 01:05:09,771
Okay.

1660
01:05:09,771 --> 01:05:11,641
- Gosh.
- What do we need to do?

1661
01:05:11,641 --> 01:05:12,941
- You need to load the cart.
- Load it here,

1662
01:05:12,941 --> 01:05:14,341
and he'll carry it.

1663
01:05:14,881 --> 01:05:16,911
Load it here, and he'll carry it.

1664
01:05:16,911 --> 01:05:17,951
(Working as planned)

1665
01:05:19,151 --> 01:05:20,181
