1719
01:07:25,041 --> 01:07:26,841
It's just the way I like it.

1720
01:07:28,211 --> 01:07:29,211
It's so tasty.

1721
01:07:30,381 --> 01:07:31,751
I love seaweed soup, and this is amazing.

1722
01:07:32,481 --> 01:07:34,021
