1725
01:07:40,491 --> 01:07:43,191
It's so tasty. This is awesome.

1726
01:07:44,061 --> 01:07:45,531
I love seaweed soup, and this is amazing.

1727
01:07:45,931 --> 01:07:50,161
(The rich flavour amazes him.)

1728
01:07:52,471 --> 01:07:54,601
