1729
01:07:56,871 --> 01:07:58,571
- It's so good.
- It's so good.

1730
01:07:59,471 --> 01:08:01,381
The soup is so thick and rich.

1731
01:08:01,641 --> 01:08:02,711
The soup is different.

1732
01:08:02,711 --> 01:08:04,151
(The soup is more savoury and thick thanks to wild rock seaweed.)

1733
01:08:05,481 --> 01:08:07,651
