1734
01:08:07,651 --> 01:08:09,751
It's just the way I like it.

1735
01:08:10,651 --> 01:08:11,691
It's so tasty.

1736
01:08:12,151 --> 01:08:14,261
(Humming)

1737
01:08:14,491 --> 01:08:17,661
(It's just the way she likes it.)

1738
01:08:18,231 --> 01:08:21,561
