1739
01:08:21,961 --> 01:08:23,001
The seaweed is crazy.

1740
01:08:26,171 --> 01:08:27,701
I should try cooking this myself.

1741
01:08:27,701 --> 01:08:29,171
(It's perfect for Hae Joon too.)

1742
01:08:29,741 --> 01:08:32,211
Its texture is...

1743
01:08:32,371 --> 01:08:35,441
soft yet chewy.

1744
01:08:36,081 --> 01:08:38,111
(Wild rock seaweed has various textures.)

1745
01:08:38,111 --> 01:08:39,111
It's interesting.

1746
01:08:39,851 --> 01:08:45,991
(It tastes even better after the manual labour.)

1747
01:08:46,291 --> 01:08:47,361
It's chewy.

1748
01:08:48,091 --> 01:08:50,961
It's not just hard.

1749
01:08:51,161 --> 01:08:52,291
It's very soft...

1750
01:08:52,291 --> 01:08:54,301
(Slurp)

1751
01:08:54,831 --> 01:08:55,901
It's interesting.

1752
01:08:55,901 --> 01:08:58,501
